    {
      "id": "3043a49a-7b98-4dea-899f-a71be979f732",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-23T11:34:54.000Z",
      "title": "High number of new directors",
      "body": "There are 5 new directors who have joined the board in the last 3 years. Executive VP of Finance, CFO & Executive Director Kapil Sharma was the last director to join the board, commencing their role in 2025. The company’s lack of board continuity is considered a risk according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model.",
