      "title": "Asset Light Expansion And Premiumisation Will Transform This Hospitality Leader By 2029",
      "body": "Catalysts About Lemon Tree Hotels Lemon Tree Hotels operates a large mid scale and upper mid scale hotel portfolio in India, with a growing presence in the premium Aurika brand and an expanding base of asset light managed and franchised rooms. What are the underlying business or industry changes driving this perspective?",
