      "body": "Analysts have nudged their price target for Lemon Tree Hotels slightly higher to ₹183.53 from ₹183.18, citing updated assumptions around discount rates, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E that, in their view, fine tune rather than overhaul the stock’s valuation story. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on February 6, 2026 to consider unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31, 2025 (Board Meeting).",
